+---
+"@agent-wechat/cli": patch
+---
+
+Check incoming sync duplicates through fresh reads on the exclusively owned profile connection cache instead of copying and hashing the entire profile for each duplicate. Keep row identity validation, account serialization, and restart recovery unchanged. Optional `WX_PROFILE_TIMINGS=1` diagnostics report copy counts, bytes and lookup duration without account or message data.
